Observation: Transient npm registry connection reset during Docker build. Use `npm ci --no-audit --no-fund` with `npm config set fetch-retries 5 fetch-retry-mintimeout 20000 fetch-retry-maxtimeout 120000 fetch-timeout 600000`, add a reliable registry mirror, enable BuildKit cache, and retry the build.
