Observation: Likely npm 6.x internal bug triggered by stale cache, corrupt lockfile, network/registry issues, or Node 14 incompatibility. Upgrade npm (`npm i -g npm@8`) or use `node:16`, clear cache (`npm cache clean --force`), remove `node_modules`/`package-lock.json`, then run `npm install --no-audit --no-fund` or `npm ci` with retries; verify dependencies support Node 14.
